{"3766500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cristamon", "steam_appid": 3766500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766500/extras/42334f9b691f12e222dcdff6829853e2.avif?t=1782390983\" width=1376 height=768 /></span>Once upon a time, a forgotten garden…</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No one has set foot here in years. The weeds have swallowed everything. But beneath the dust and the silence, something is waiting to live again. And you're the one who'll wake it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">One sweep of the broom changes everything 🧹</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Clean, clear, tidy — and watch the color return, corner after corner. No clock. No game over. Just that delicious satisfaction of bringing a place back to life with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pockets full of treasures 🃏</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The garden hasn't given up all its secrets. Cards to collect, hidden surprises, little finds that make you smile… the more you dig, the more it reveals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">And beyond the gate? 🌿</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This garden is only the beginning. Other places lie sleeping — further out, stranger, more beautiful — locked away, for now. It's up to you to find how to wake them… and to discover what they hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your little slice of paradise, forever ☀️</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade, decorate, shape it your way. Bloom &amp; Broom is the cozy place you come back to at night to unwind — a bright world that only wishes you well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Wake the garden. See how far it takes you.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766500/extras/42334f9b691f12e222dcdff6829853e2.avif?t=1782390983\" width=1376 height=768 /></span>Once upon a time, a forgotten garden…</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No one has set foot here in years. The weeds have swallowed everything. But beneath the dust and the silence, something is waiting to live again. And you're the one who'll wake it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">One sweep of the broom changes everything 🧹</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Clean, clear, tidy — and watch the color return, corner after corner. No clock. No game over. Just that delicious satisfaction of bringing a place back to life with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pockets full of treasures 🃏</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The garden hasn't given up all its secrets. Cards to collect, hidden surprises, little finds that make you smile… the more you dig, the more it reveals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">And beyond the gate? 🌿</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This garden is only the beginning. Other places lie sleeping — further out, stranger, more beautiful — locked away, for now. It's up to you to find how to wake them… and to discover what they hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-al